# armour/shared/pauldron_plate5_l: the great PLATE pauldron on the left shoulder (plate.5; ARMOUR-X, wave 2: PLAN "The envelope in production", STYLE_P2 29).
# the plate pauldron grown great: a broad cop, flat across its top and rounded only at the outer corner, lit at its
# top-left with a two-pixel glint, over two hinged lames with dark seams (the plate family's great / legend size).
# 5 px past the 16 px shoulder line facing D (26 across with its pair; STYLE_P2 29.3). Side views wider and hanging lower.
# Rides the lean and the bob and lifts a pixel on wind-ups (`up`).
# Finish regions: R the last lame's hem, P the cop's face and the lames' lit rows, N the seams, G the glint.
# Shared by the man and the woman (D10). Generated by ARMOUR-X genx.py from shapesx.py (re-run, never
# hand-edit the derived views). Format: rpg/art/doll/doll.h.
use person
role pauldron plate.5
layer armNear
anchor shoulderL
keys pauld
z 5
side L

